{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以明返照世間是解脫，以彌伽、解脫二俗士表之。有國名住林，十二年行方至，以表十二緣生觀達一終。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以海幢比丘表之。離出入息，無復思覺，神用無方，皆悉自在也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以滿願優婆夷表之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名色是生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名色識三六根為分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下\n經云「十二有支皆有種業」，如經自具明也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "愛取\n有生老死是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0768001", "type": "mod", "text": "解【大】＊，釋華嚴經十二緣生解【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0768002", "type": "mod", "text": "論【大】，論一卷【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0768003", "type": "mod", "text": "唐【大】，〔－〕【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0768004", "type": "mod", "text": "釋十二緣生【大】，〔－〕【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0770001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0770001", "type": "mod", "text": "度【大】，量【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0770002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0770002", "type": "mod", "text": "是【大】，自【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0771001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0771001", "type": "mod", "text": "有【大】，〔－〕【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0772001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0772001", "type": "mod", "text": "周【大】，同【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0772002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0772002", "type": "mod", "text": "干【大】，竽【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0767001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0767001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】寬文九年刊大谷大學藏本，【宮】宮內省圖書寮藏宋本，但宮本敘文缺"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0768001", "type": "orig", "text": "（釋華嚴經十二緣生）＋解【宮】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0768002", "type": "orig", "text": "論＋（一卷）【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0768003", "type": "orig", "text": "〔唐〕－【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0768004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0768004", "type": "orig", "text": "〔釋十二緣生〕－【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0770001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0770001", "type": "orig", "text": "度＝量【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0770002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0770002", "type": "orig", "text": "是＝自【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0771001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0771001", "type": "orig", "text": "〔有〕－【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0772001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0772001", "type": "orig", "text": "周＝同【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0772002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0772002", "type": "orig", "text": "干＝竽【宮】"}
